+
+`arena_profile_identity_research.rs` sketches that separate identity strategy without changing any RaceV1 source bytes. It hashes a path-labeled, length-framed candidate inventory of Arena proof and shared model sources together with a caller-supplied SHA-256 digest of the external `sora-arena` combat kernel. The external digest is **unverified** here, and the inventory omits still-missing general combat, catalog, and payout verifier sources. The resulting source root is deliberately not an `ExecutionProofProfileV1`, is absent from the compiled registry, and cannot open or settle a session. Complete source inclusion, reproducible cross-repository artifact verification, exact compiled verifier semantics, and qualification remain required before an ArenaV1 profile can be registered.
+
