+## Exact deposits and proof allocations
+
+The first-release wire requires `GameParticipantV1.deposit`, `GameAdmissionParticipantV1.deposit`, and `GameOutcomeV1.allocations`. There is no decoder fallback for records without these fields. The roster commitment includes the exact deposit; the outcome commitment includes the complete ordered allocation vector.
+
+`NoPayout` admits only zero deposits. `EqualWinnersOrRefund` admits exactly the opened session's `stake` per slot and preserves its equal-share award policy. `VerifiedAllocations` interprets the opened `stake` as a minimum: each `JoinGameSessionV1.expected_stake` is the exact wallet-authorized deposit, which must meet that minimum and the immutable payout precision. Only this policy permits unequal deposits. Admission retains every original amount and increases custody liability by exactly the approved amount.
